WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,970 --> 00:00:09,250
Go straight through, don't stop, don't slow down

2
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:28,600
next

3
00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:40,550
If you can't make it through, go back a little and turn off the engine.

4
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:42,950
You can't force your way in, and you can't stay here for a long time.

5
00:00:43,230 --> 00:00:44,990
See if there is another way around it

6
00:00:46,650 --> 00:00:49,480
Yes, I remember there was an old road

7
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:51,960
I can get around this circle, but it's not easy to get around.

8
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:55,910
It was a dirt road in the past, maybe the navigation didn’t even show the route.

9
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:58,000
Over there, it should be
